# Bounded tables for the unchanged max4 point maps

These tables group 64 point images per integer. Each is checked pointwise
against the original ATLAS generator table. This avoids repeatedly reducing
long shifts through the full table while checking words; it changes no group
or generator. No order or orbit-coverage theorem is used.

Source: the ATLAS max4 program and degree-4060 permutation data, attributed in
`SylowOvergroups.Definitions`. All generated data are checked by the kernel.
-/

